Multi-Character Universe: Dedicated characters for Krishna (🦚), Radha (🌸), Shiva (🔱), Ganesha (🐘), and Hanuman (🚩), alongside an extensible future architecture showcasing Lakshmi, Saraswati, Rama, and Durga with interactive launch notifications.
