Gifting Studio ("Give Them a Story"): Occasion filter, personalized seed paper gift message customizer, luxury gift wrap choices, and direct recipient dispatch.
Grouped Search: Search modal filtering across Characters, Stories, Toys, and Collections.
Cart, Wishlist & Checkout: Slide-over drawer with free shipping progress bar, promo code validation (KATHA10), wishlist manager, and verified checkout flow with printable order receipts.
Artisan Operations & Analytics: Admin drawer to adjust live toy stock, review mock orders, and monitor value analytics.
