How to fix it on your Vercel deployment (kathakrafts-4aidxigua-katha-krafts.vercel.app)
Open your Firebase Authentication Settings directly:
https://console.firebase.google.com/project/gen-lang-client-0529875680/authentication/settings
Under Authorized domains, click Add domain.
Add kathakrafts-4aidxigua-katha-krafts.vercel.app and save.
Tip for future Vercel deployments: Every individual Vercel preview build gets a new random hash (like 4aidxigua), and Firebase does not allow wildcard *.vercel.app entries. Also add your stable Vercel production domain (e.g., kathakrafts.vercel.app or your custom domain) to Authorized domains and test Google Sign-In on that stable URL so it continues working across future deploys.